      "id": "file:month02/week03/lexer.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "lexer.cpp",
      "filePath": "month02/week03/lexer.cpp",
      "summary": "词法模块 month03.week03.lexer 的实现单元：lex() 单遍扫描表达式文本，识别数字、标识符、四则运算符和括号并转成 Token 序列，数字用 std::from_chars 转换并检查有限性，失败时经 std::expected 返回带字节位置的错误。",
      "tags": ["lexer", "词法分析", "token", "utility", "错误处理"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "C++23 风格：用 std::expected<std::vector<Token>, Error> 替代异常传递词法错误，错误携带 stage/position/message 三元组便于定位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:month02/week03/lexer.cppm",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "lexer.cppm",
      "filePath": "month02/week03/lexer.cppm",
      "summary": "词法模块的接口单元：定义贯穿全课程的 ErrorStage/Error 错误模型与 TokenKind/Token 词法单元类型，并导出 lex() 声明，是表达式前端所有错误信息的公共定义处。",
      "tags": ["module-interface", "type-definition", "token", "错误模型"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
