      "type": "file",
      "name": "main.cpp",
      "filePath": "month02/week03/main.cpp",
      "summary": "week03 演示入口：只 import engine 门面模块，创建矩形后在批次内绑定 area/width 公式，依次演示修改长宽后的增量重算、批内失败保持原值、以及无效输入等错误路径。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "demo", "console", "增量重算"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:month02/week03/parser.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "parser.cpp",
      "filePath": "month02/week03/parser.cpp",
      "summary": "递归下降解析器的实现单元：内部 Parser 类按 加减→乘除→一元→初级 四层优先级链把 Token 流构建成 AST，带最大嵌套深度防护，对外提供 parse()（词法+语法一步完成）与 describe() 调试输出。",
      "tags": ["parser", "递归下降", "ast", "语法分析"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "每个优先级一层递归函数，用 unique_ptr 的 Tree 表达节点的唯一所有权；嵌套深度超限与悬余 Token 都转为 ParseFailure 异常再统一折成 Error。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:month02/week03/parser.cppm",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "parser.cppm",
      "filePath": "month02/week03/parser.cppm",
      "summary": "语法模块接口单元：导出 NodeKind/Node/Tree 等 AST 类型与 parse()/describe() 声明，并 export import lexer，让使用者一次导入即可获得完整表达式前端。",
      "tags": ["module-interface", "ast", "type-definition"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
